# Bank Customer Churn Analysis

This Power BI project explores churn behavior across a bank’s customer base using a 2-page interactive dashboard.

## Tools Used
- Power BI
- Power Query (for data cleaning)
- DAX (for custom measures)

## Files Included
- `Toluwani's Bank+Customer+Churn PowerBi Clean.pbix` — the full Power BI dashboard file  
- `Toluwani's Bank+Customer+Churn Analysis pdf` — a PDF showing both dashboard pages

## Key Insights
- Inactive members churn nearly twice as much as active ones  
- Middle-aged customers (46–55) show the highest churn  
- Long tenure does not always mean loyalty  
- German females churn the most, French males the least  
- High earners and high balance customers churn more. Expectations may be driving it

